OL,3,GNEWSAMan arrested after shots fired at
OL,4,Ahouse in village
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested after shots
OL,7,Fwere fired at a house in a village in
OL,8,FLeicestershire.
OL,10,FOfficers were called to Ravenstone Road
OL,11,Fin Heather, near Coalville, just after
OL,12,F22:00 BST on Wednesday after damage was
OL,13,Fcaused to the window of a house and a
OL,14,Fcar parked outside the property.
OL,16,FLeicestershire Police said the damage
OL,17,Fwas "consistent with a firearms
OL,18,Fdischarge".
